title: '"multiply-reachable leaves" : folder'
pid: ac4e08f2-9025-4683-91c5-e77a03003cad
body: |2-
  If a (root, origin)'s recursive content
  links to a leaf multiple ways,
  provide a folder at the origin for the multiply-reachable leaves.

  The folder should perhaps be "choked contentward"
  to the nearest common containerward node,
  to avoid bloated root folders.
